{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the sound library.",
    "Read by scripts/seed-music.mjs (upload + upsert) and imported verbatim by constants/musicCatalog.ts (the offline fallback the picker uses before the table is seeded), so the two can never drift.",
    "",
    "For every track you must be able to answer 'where did this come from and what do I owe the artist':",
    "  localFile   - path (repo-relative) to the audio file you downloaded/licensed. Preferred.",
    "  sourceUrl   - used only when localFile is absent: the script fetches it once, then never depends on it again.",
    "  license     - CC0-1.0 | CC-BY-4.0 | PIXABAY | LICENSED | UNVERIFIED (default, and the script will complain).",
    "  attribution - the exact credit string the license obliges you to show. CC-BY requires it; the UI renders it.",
    "  licenseUrl  - permalink to the license text at download time, as evidence.",
    "",
    "Do not commit the audio files themselves: assets/sounds/ is gitignored. Drop the files there, run",
    "'npm run seed:music', and the script uploads them to the Supabase `sounds` bucket and upserts the rows.",
    "Keep the ids stable - posts snapshot music_track_id, and re-keying a track orphans the label on old posts."
